ルガトリウムの夜」HO1\n・たんぽぽの相棒刑事。班長。\n・見た目は隼、中身はウサギの繊細優男。\n・いつも穏やかだが、見た目は怖い。\n・セリフ例「タンポポ、仕事の時間だよ。気を引き締めていこうか。」「前に見たサバンナ特集が忘れられないよ。子鹿が食べられたのを見て寝込んだな…。」\n\n2人の雰囲気：穏やかでのほほんとしててゆるゆる。仲良し。居酒屋やウサギカフェによく行く。お互いコミュニケーションが下手くそなので、よくワタワタしている。\n\n■ 使用用途\n個人利用、友達に見せる\n \n■ 納品形式\nPNG、PSD\n\n何卒よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BM_ek7SuV8zgRatrpqiOadnFh1_BJ3sL", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1198454, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "宇都屁ぷ", "screen_name": "udohepu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1303050676260413442/RiDeEK6R.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4913519827/1690934804/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 16}, {"id": 3110961, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "廿", "screen_name": "3rd_ni10", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1996571113233764352/j0c90VZc.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1282595214830432256/1605430356/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "novel"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 3518494, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "げいどん鯨呑🐋", "screen_name": "Osakana_Pack", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2020500282250252288/h5B3kFKI.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1505214997252562944/1740760576/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "po